<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Sci-fi</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong> Standard layout. Containment procedure, Description, addendums</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> Object makes impact with moon and researchers at Lunar Area-32 find a parasitic lifeform with anomalous properties in the substance left by the object.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> A object collides with the moon not far from Lunar Area-32 and a team sets out to investigate it. At the impact site they find a crater with a dark substance from which they take samples and return to base. Further study of the substance shows that it contains a parasite that will enter the human body through a body opening or wound and attach to the brain stem. Once attached the host will experience anomalous effects.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> It's a quite simple story that I hope to make interesting through exploration of the SCP and it's effects, and possibly how it could be used to the foundations benefit,</p>
